chx:Research a res:ResearchProject ; rdfs:label "CSV, JSON and XML files for an advanced course: chapter 18 and today's csv, json, xml.etree.ElementTree and Python"@en ;
    sen0414:methodology "Primary source first: the chapter's named concepts from the textbook ontology built over the published chapter. Then the official documentation for the current release and the PEPs the chapter's topics touch. Every source opened and read on 2026-10-12T12:00:00; every claim taken from text actually read; every behaviour executed under Python 3.14.6." ;
    res:hasResearchScope chx:Scope ; rdfs:member chx:P01, chx:P02, chx:P03, chx:P04, chx:P05, chx:P06, chx:P07, chx:P08, chx:P09, chx:P10, chx:P11, chx:P12, chx:P13, chx:P14, chx:P15, chx:P16, chx:P17, chx:P18, chx:P19, chx:P20, chx:P21, chx:P22, chx:P23, chx:P24, chx:P25, chx:P26, chx:P27, chx:P28, chx:P29, chx:P30, chx:P31, chx:P32, chx:P33, chx:P34, chx:P35, chx:P36, chx:P37, chx:P38, chx:P39, chx:P40, chx:P41, chx:P42, chx:P43, chx:P44, chx:P45, chx:P46, chx:P47, chx:P48, chx:P49, chx:P50, chx:P51, chx:P52, chx:P53, chx:P54, chx:P55, chx:P56, chx:P57, chx:P58, chx:P59, chx:P60, chx:P61, chx:P62, chx:P63, chx:P64 .
chx:Scope a res:ResearchScope ; res:hasResearchQuestion "What does chapter 18 of the 3rd edition teach about reading and writing CSV, JSON and XML files with the csv module, the json module, xml.etree.ElementTree and xmltodict, which of its printed outputs, programs and statements still hold under Python 3.14.6 (with xmltodict 1.0.4 and openpyxl 3.1.5, and with the versions its Appendix A pins), and what must an advanced course correct or add so that it matches the current modules and the standards behind the formats?" ; res:hasTimeWindow "Current as of 2026-10-12." .
